@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: Trigger Update Validation
	Validating trigger updates in zendesk and alerting when updates to triggers have been made

Scenario: Number of Active Triggers
	Test that checks for any newly added or removed active triggers

	* there should be "364" active triggers in zendesk

Scenario: App Survey Update ticket
	Check trigger for updates and notify if trigger has been updated

	* the trigger "App - Survey - Update ticket" should have "2022-12-15T18:13:41Z" as its update date

